sequenceDiagram
  participant Bundler
  participant API as Pramana API
  participant Parser as UserOp Parser
  participant Flow as Monitoring Pipeline
  participant Att as Attestation Service
  participant DB as SQLite

  Bundler->>API: POST /bundler/validate (UserOperation)
  API->>Parser: Parse and canonicalize hash
  Parser-->>API: user_op_hash and ChainEvent
  API->>Flow: Execute L1 and routing
  Flow-->>API: decision, risk_score, trace_hash
  API->>Att: sign(user_op_hash, decision, risk, trace)
  Att->>DB: store attestation nonce and TTL
  Att-->>API: signed payload
  API-->>Bundler: 200 decision + signature
  Bundler->>API: POST /bundler/confirm
  API->>DB: mark redeemed
  API-->>Bundler: confirmation accepted
